XFAIL: system-windows

Environment changes a parent makes for its child (added, empty, non-ASCII
and removed variables) reach the child through catter.
Known failures: #127 (non-ASCII environment values on Windows).

RUN: %e2e probe env | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe env | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS env
